<div class="row mt-5 service-section-block">
    <div class="col-md-10 offset-md-1">
        <div class="frame-service-desc">
            <h3>Travel & Destination Management</h3>
            <p class="frame-service-text">
                Your first friend for your travel goals – MICE Hospitality. And we live up to this mighty responsibility in every true sense. Right from a swanky 5-star rated holiday or a no-frill business trip, our plans are tailor-fit to your preferences. Individuals or for corporate groups, we got some good experience to our credit for managing and ensuring an end-to-end travel itinerary. Our commercial knowledge drives our delivery with large corporations as well as SMEs who outsource their entire travel management and operations to us for efficiency with their business travel policy. In fact, our attention to details is a well-accomplished fact with all our partners.<br /><br />
                So, when is your next travel plan?

            </p>
